{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05565","headline":"丽正殿赐宴同勒天前烟年四韵应制 · 王湾","name":"丽正殿赐宴同勒天前烟年四韵应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金殿忝陪贤，琼羞忽降天。\n鼎罗仙掖里，觞拜琐闱前。\n院逼青霄路，厨和紫禁烟。\n酒酣空忭舞，何以荅昌年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}